WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.065
<v Narration>Meet EchoFlow. Teach it once, then just ask.

00:00:06.121 --> 00:00:09.305
<v Request>Order a Garlic Bread on Domino's.

00:00:10.655 --> 00:00:17.438
<v EchoFlow>I don't know how to "order a garlic bread on Domino's" yet. Want to teach me? Say yes, then show me.

00:00:17.826 --> 00:00:19.498
<v Request>Yes.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:26.677
<v EchoFlow>Okay, show me in Domino's. Tap Done when you're finished. I never pay.

00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:32.528
<v Narration>We show it once: search for garlic bread, add it, and open the cart.

00:00:50.401 --> 00:00:55.737
<v EchoFlow>Learned: order a garlic bread on dominos. I saved 4 steps. You can change the item.

00:00:55.737 --> 00:00:57.987
<v EchoFlow>You can see it in the EchoFlow app.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:03.802
<v Narration>One demonstration, saved as a lesson. Now, the exact same request.

00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:09.788
<v Request>Order a Garlic Bread on Domino's.

00:01:11.131 --> 00:01:13.784
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order a garlic bread on dominos.

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.977
<v Narration>It replays the lesson by itself, and stops at payment. Paying is always up to you.

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:39.605
<v EchoFlow>Your turn. Everything is ready for payment. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:49.655
<v Narration>Now different words, for the same task.

00:01:54.694 --> 00:01:57.758
<v Request>Get me garlic bread from Domino's.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:01.641
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order a garlic bread on dominos.

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:08.209
<v Narration>It understands the new wording on the phone, and sees the garlic bread is already in the cart.

00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:25.656
<v EchoFlow>Garlic bread was already in your cart, so I didn't add another one. Your turn.

00:02:25.656 --> 00:02:30.927
<v EchoFlow>Everything is ready for payment. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.729
<v Narration>Next, a new item, and a quantity it was never shown.

00:02:36.949 --> 00:02:40.397
<v Request>Order two Choco Lava Cakes on Domino's.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:44.698
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order 2 choco lava cake on dominos.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:52.319
<v Narration>Two choco lava cakes, from a single garlic bread lesson. It sets the quantity in the cart itself.

00:03:06.948 --> 00:03:12.758
<v EchoFlow>Your turn. Everything is ready for payment. I won't pay. Please check the order and pay yourself.

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:20.571
<v Narration>Finally, a dish that doesn't exist.

00:03:21.483 --> 00:03:24.907
<v Request>Order a unicorn pizza on Domino's.

00:03:26.278 --> 00:03:29.265
<v EchoFlow>Okay, order a unicorn pizza on dominos.

00:03:41.419 --> 00:03:46.290
<v EchoFlow>I searched for "unicorn pizza" but couldn't find it. What should I get instead?

00:03:46.675 --> 00:03:48.347
<v Request>Nothing.

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:55.746
<v EchoFlow>I searched for "unicorn pizza" but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 3 without adding anything.

00:03:57.240 --> 00:04:01.053
<v Narration>It asks, instead of guessing, and stops without adding anything.

00:04:10.762 --> 00:04:13.226
<v Request>Did the last run succeed?

00:04:14.528 --> 00:04:16.668
<v EchoFlow>No, the last run didn't succeed.

00:04:16.668 --> 00:04:21.484
<v EchoFlow>Order a unicorn pizza on dominos stopped at step 3 of 4 (Tap "btn add").

00:04:21.484 --> 00:04:28.172
<v EchoFlow>I searched for "unicorn pizza" but couldn't find it. So I stopped at step 3 without adding anything.

00:04:29.220 --> 00:04:33.303
<v Narration>Teach once. Ask any way. Payment stays with you.
